{
    "version": "0.4.0",
    "description": "An open-source workbench for always-on agents. One process, one SQLite file.",
    "homepage": "https://eta.0xfe.tech",
    "license": "MIT",
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "url": "https://github.com/0xfe-project/eta/releases/download/v0.4.0/eta-host-windows-x64.exe#/eta-host.exe",
            "hash": "eb62a09908ad750aafda40dba8e2c5695100f4775576b6f21bb1e00fbbc73351"
        }
    },
    "bin": "eta-host.exe",
    "notes": [
        "这是 0xfe-project/eta 的官方稳定版 eta-host（当前 v0.4.0），不是 lingwcy/eta 或 Mangi-11/Eta。",
        "在终端运行 eta-host，然后用浏览器打开 http://127.0.0.1:8787 。数据目录是 %USERPROFILE%\\.eta。",
        "官方桌面端仍是实验性预发布，本清单未收录。Windows 上官方不支持受限沙箱。",
        "首次使用需在设置里添加模型源（订阅设备码或 OpenAI 兼容接口）。记忆功能需要按官方文档另配 sidecar，普通对话里不一定能直接看到。",
        "请用 scoop update eta 更新；不要依赖应用内自动更新。",
        "便携化会把 %USERPROFILE%\\.eta 映射到 Scoop persist；若安装时该目录正被 Eta 占用，安装会失败或跳过迁移，需先自行关闭占用程序。"
    ],
    "checkver": {
        "github": "https://github.com/0xfe-project/eta"
    },
    "autoupdate": {
        "architecture": {
            "64bit": {
                "url": "https://github.com/0xfe-project/eta/releases/download/v$version/eta-host-windows-x64.exe#/eta-host.exe",
                "hash": {
                    "url": "https://github.com/0xfe-project/eta/releases/download/v$version/SHA256SUMS"
                }
            }
        }
    },
    "portableProfile": {
        "mappings": [
            {
                "label": "home",
                "source": "UserProfile/.eta",
                "target": "$persist_dir/home",
                "strategy": "symlink",
                "ensureTarget": true
            }
        ]
    }
}
